                <pb facs="0194" n="104" sameAs="frus:frus1875v01/pg104"/>


                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">exports of coffee from rio.</hi></head>
                <p>Exports, estimated in bags of 60 kilograms (132¼ pounds) each,<anchor n="*"
                        xml:id="d69-f1"/> during the last twenty-seven years, from 1st of January to
                    31st of December, in each year, from 1851 to <pb facs="0195" n="105"
                        xml:id="pg105"/> 1874, both included; showing, also, the quantity exported
                    to the United States and that sent to all other countries together: thus
                    demonstrating the comparative importance to Brazil of the consumption in the
                    United States and the consumption in all other countries; showing also a larger
                    export from Rio to the United States, while the duty existed there, than since
                    (July 1, 1872) it has been free.</p>
