    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d69-f1" n="*" xml:id="d69-f1-content">
                <p>Until within a short time coffee was sold and the prices quoted by the arroba,
                    (32 pounds,) and was exported in bags of 5 arrobas (160 pounds) each. It is now
                    quoted at the price for 10 kilograms, (22 pounds,) and is exported in bags of 60
                    kilograms (132¼ pounds) each.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d69-f2" n="*" xml:id="d69-f2-content">
                <p>5 cents duty.</p>
